        "original_id": "8bb98004-338b-5b0f-9771-1d9592ae1289",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Channing Tatum, Duke\n- Products: G.I. Joe toyline, comic books, cartoon series, live-action films, 12-inch action figures\n- Organizations: Hasbro\n- Concepts: G.I. Joe Hall of Fame era\n\nFacts:\n- In 1980, Channing Matthew Tatum was born on April 26 and is an American actor.\n- In 1991, Hasbro began the G.I. Joe Hall of Fame era of 12-inch action figures by releasing the Target Exclusive Duke.\n- In 1991, Hasbro released the Target Exclusive Duke in response to high demand from nostalgic collectors of vintage-era G.I. Joe action figures.\n- In 2005, Channing Tatum made his film debut in the drama film \"Coach Carter.\"\n- In 2009, Channing Tatum portrayed Duke in the live-action film \"G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra.\"\n- In 2013, Channing Tatum portrayed Duke again in the sequel \"G.I. Joe: Retaliation.\"\n- Duke is a fictional character from the G.I. Joe toyline, comic books, and cartoon series.",
